[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0010","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0020","text":"好的，请讲～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0030","text":"哇，不好意思……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0040","text":"没事～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0050","text":"……要是太拼命的话，\n大家会担心您的哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0060","text":"说、说得是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0070","text":"──不过\n叶月小姐也是一样的哦……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0080","text":"叶月小姐也是特别认真努力的人\n希望您千万不要勉强自己或者硬撑──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0090","text":"……不，比起我您做事有条理多了\n我根本没资格说这种话对吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000200_04_0100","text":"……呵呵，谢谢您\n我会记住的～"}]
